NAME
    tree - Display a text tree of all subdirectories below the current directory or an optional path. The traversal is bounded to 32 levels.

SYNOPSIS
    tree [path]

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Display a text tree of all subdirectories below the current directory or an optional path. The traversal is bounded to 32 levels.

EXAMPLES
    tree
    tree \INU

FILES
    /System/Commands/TREE.CMD
    /INU/HELP/TREE.MAN
